.TH AICODER 1 "2026" "0.9.2" "AILinux Tools"
.SH NAME
aicoder \- Terminal Coding & DevOps Agent (AILinux/TriForce)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aicoder
[\fICOMMAND\fR] [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Terminalbasierter autonomer Agent. Ohne Argumente startet Setup+REPL.
.SH COMMANDS
ask, chat, task, review, agent, shell, sudo, sysinfo, service,
model, fallback, swarm, status, models, broadcast, hist, init
.SH EXAMPLES
.B aicoder
(Setup + Agent-REPL)
.br
.B aicoder agent "Zeige Docker-Status"
.br
.B aicoder ask "Was macht diese Funktion?" --model groq/llama-3.3-70b-versatile
